<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LightRFP ESBD Report</title>
    <style>
        :root { --bg:#f4f1ea; --panel:#fffdf8; --ink:#1d2a31; --muted:#5d6a71; --accent:#0f6a73; --accent-soft:#d8ecee; --line:#d9d0c3; --good:#305f3b; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin:0; font-family:Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; color:var(--ink); background:radial-gradient(circle at top right, #efe2c6 0, transparent 30%), linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f1e7 0%, #f1ede5 100%); }
        .page { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:32px 20px 48px; }
        .hero, .section, .card { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(44, 56, 67, 0.06); }
        .hero { padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px; }
        h1, h2, h3 { margin:0; line-height:1.1; }
        h1 { font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.3rem); letter-spacing:0.02em; }
        .subtitle { margin-top:12px; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.05rem; max-width:60rem; }
        .stats { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap:14px; margin-top:24px; }
        .stat { padding:16px; background:#fbf8f1; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--line); }
        .stat-label { color:var(--muted); font-size:0.85rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; }
        .stat-value { display:block; margin-top:6px; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:bold; }
        .results { display:grid; gap:18px; }
        .card { padding:22px; }
        .card-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px; margin-bottom:14px; }
        .title-row { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px; }
        .rank-badge { min-width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--accent); background:#edf5f6; border:1px solid #c9dfe1; flex-shrink:0; }
        .card-title a { color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; }
        .card-title a:hover { color:var(--accent); }
        .badges { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; justify-content:flex-end; }
        .badge { padding:7px 11px; border-radius:999px; font-size:0.86rem; font-weight:bold; background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent); }
        .badge.score { background:#e5f2e7; color:var(--good); }
        .meta { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap:10px 18px; margin:16px 0; padding:16px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
        .meta strong { display:block; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:4px; }
        .description { font-size:1rem; line-height:1.6; }
        .list { margin:12px 0 0; padding-left:18px; }
        .section { padding:24px; margin-top:28px; }
        .section p, .section li { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6; }
        .attachments a { color:var(--accent); }
        @media (max-width:700px) { .card-head { flex-direction:column; } .badges { justify-content:flex-start; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>LightRFP ESBD Opportunity Report</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">
                Ranked government solicitation matches from the Texas Electronic State Business Daily.
                Generated at {{ generated_at }} from live data at <a href="{{ source_url }}">{{ source_url }}</a>.
            </p>
            <div class="stats">
                <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Source</span><span class="stat-value">ESBD</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Candidates Analyzed</span><span class="stat-value">{{ total_candidates }}</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Results Shown</span><span class="stat-value">{{ results|length }} / {{ top_n }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <div class="results">
            {% for item in results %}
            <article class="card">
                <div class="card-head">
                    <div class="title-row">
                        <div class="rank-badge">#{{ loop.index }}</div>
                        <div class="card-title"><h2><a href="{{ item.detail_url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h2></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="badges">
                        <span class="badge score">Score {{ "%.2f"|format(item.relevance_score) }}</span>
                        {% for category in item.matched_categories %}
                        <span class="badge">{{ category }}</span>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="meta">
                    <div><strong>Solicitation ID</strong>{{ item.solicitation_id }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Agency</strong>{{ item.agency_name or item.agency_number }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Status</strong>{{ item.status }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Posted</strong>{{ item.posting_date }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Due</strong>{{ item.due_date }} {{ item.due_time }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Classification</strong>{{ item.category_classification or "Not listed" }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Contact</strong>{{ item.contact_name or "Not listed" }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Email</strong>{{ item.contact_email or item.bid_response_email or "Not listed" }}</div>
                    <div><strong>Phone</strong>{{ item.contact_phone or "Not listed" }}</div>
                </div>
                <p class="description">{{ item.brief_description or item.description or "No description available." }}</p>
                {% if item.attachment_urls %}
                <div class="attachments">
                    <h3>Attachments</h3>
                    <ul class="list">
                        {% for attachment in item.attachment_urls %}
                        <li><a href="{{ attachment.url }}">{{ attachment.name }}</a>{% if attachment.description %} - {{ attachment.description }}{% endif %}</li>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
                {% if item.score_explanation %}
                <div>
                    <h3>Why it ranked</h3>
                    <ul class="list">
                        {% for reason in item.score_explanation %}
                        <li>{{ reason }}</li>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Methodology</h2>
            <p>This report uses the live paginated ESBD backend service to collect the full current open-solicitation result set, then fetches each solicitation detail page to extract required fields such as title, solicitation ID, contact information, posting date, due date, classification, and attachment links.</p>
            <p>Relevance is determined by weighted keyword and fuzzy matching against the vendor service categories from the take-home brief. Matches in solicitation titles and classification codes count more heavily than weaker description-only signals, while clearly unrelated terms such as software-only or legal-service signals are penalized.</p>
            <p>This implementation favors a straightforward HTTP-first scraper because the required ESBD data is available through the public site and its live JSON listing service without browser automation. Some additional relevance signals may still live inside attached PDFs, which are linked here but not yet parsed in this MVP.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
